.TH AUTOMAP 1 "2026-09" "automap" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
automap \- generate an architecture map from a source tree
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B automap
.I command
.RI [ root ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads a source tree and writes an architecture document from it: the module
graph, its components and cycles, layering violations, entry points, types
and the ADRs that explain them.
.PP
Every fact it prints comes from the source tree or from git, and carries a
.IR file:line
or a commit hash \(em so the document can be checked against the code rather
than believed.
.PP
The default root is the current directory.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B map
Write the architecture document (the default use).
.TP
.B check
Compare the tree against the recorded baseline and report drift.
.TP
.B adr
Collect the architecture decision records.
.TP
.B langs
Report the languages found, and how they were detected.
.TP
.B rules
Print the layering rules in force.
.TP
.B types
Extract types and class diagrams.
.TP
.B journeys
Extract entry points and navigation paths.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-o " FILE" ", " \-\-out " FILE"
Where the document is written (default
.IR ARCHITECTURE.md ).
.TP
.BI \-\-adr\-dir " DIR"
Where the decision records live (default
.IR docs/adr ).
.TP
.BI \-\-baseline " FILE"
Baseline used by
.B check
(default
.IR .automap.baseline.json ).
.TP
.B \-\-blame
Ask git which commit introduced each edge. Slower.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-git
Do not consult git at all.
.TP
.B \-\-include\-tests
Include test files in the graph.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-journeys
Skip entry point and navigation extraction.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-types
Skip type extraction and class diagrams.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-code
Skip the inside-the-files pass; graph analysis only.
.TP
.B \-\-full
No review-budget caps: every node, edge and symbol.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I .automap.baseline.json
Recorded baseline that
.B check
compares against.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The document was written, or
.B check
found no drift.
.TP
.B non-zero
.B check
found drift, or the tree could not be read.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Write the architecture document:
.PP
.RS
.B automap map . \-o ARCHITECTURE.md
.RE
.PP
Fail CI when the architecture drifts:
.PP
.RS
.B automap check .
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR arch-map (1),
.BR git (1).
Project documentation:
https://github.com/fabiocicerchia/automap
